// "Line-AoE -> BasicBeam (closest fit; Veloren has no line geometry).
// Render as a SINGLE instantaneous pulse (beam_duration ~= 0), NOT a
// sustained channel like Witch Bolt" per the sheet's own notes. Same
// near-zero-duration approximation as silver_lance.ron in this folder:
// `beam_duration: 0.25` with `tick_rate: 5.0` (tick_dur = 0.2s)
// guarantees exactly one damage tick before the beam ends.
//
// `damage_kind` hardcodes to `DamageKind::Energy` on `BasicBeam`
// regardless of RON content (common/src/states/basic_beam.rs) -- despite
// the Lightning flavor text this deals generic Energy damage under the
// hood, same drift silver_lance.ron documents. `specifier: Lightning` is
// the one spell in this pair where the FrontendSpecifier and the flavor
// text actually agree (VFX-only; still no mechanical effect on
// damage_kind).
//
// Circle 3, same band as silver_lance.ron: `energy_drain: 152` over the
// 0.25s pulse spends ~38 energy total. Flagged for wave-close-out balance
// review alongside silver_lance.ron.
BasicBeam(
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    beam_duration: 0.25,
    damage: 40.0,
    tick_rate: 5.0,
    range: 30.0,
    max_angle: 5.0,
    damage_effect: None,
    energy_regen: 0,
    energy_drain: 152,
    move_efficiency: 0.3,
    ori_rate: 0.3,
    specifier: Lightning,
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Arcane)),
)
